trota-os (1.0.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * The system identifies itself as Trota OS (ID=trota, ID_LIKE=ubuntu
    debian); unattended-upgrades and python-apt keep working with explicit
    origins and templates; Firefox security updates are automatic.
  * GDM sessions named Trota OS; no file indexer, GNOME Software or Ubuntu
    Pro notifier at login; Flatpak applications updated by a daily timer.
  * The snapd pin and the Ubuntu Pro settings move to trota-release.
  * New package trota-server-settings for the Server, Edge and Cloud images.

 -- TestardStudios <maintainers@testardstudios.invalid>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

trota-os (1.0.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * First release of Trota OS 1.0 "Fario", based on Ubuntu 24.04 LTS.
  * New packages: trota-artwork, trota-release, trota-desktop-settings,
    trota-common, trota-welcome, trota-system-info, trota-diagnostics,
    trota-package-helper, trota-docs, trota-desktop, trota-software-sources.
  * No snaps: Firefox from Mozilla's APT repository, GNOME Software with
    Flathub, snapd blocked by an APT pin, no Ubuntu Pro advertising.

 -- TestardStudios <maintainers@testardstudios.invalid>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
